{"id":"bomb-fish","name":{"en":"Bomb Fish","ja":"バクダンウオ"},"desc":{"en":"Touch me and you shall perish. That's the message it conveys from its spikes. It explodes when it thinks its life is in danger.","ja":"俺に触ると怪我するぜと言わんばかりに全身 をトゲトゲさせた魚。それだけでも厄介なの に、身に危険が及ぶと、相手もろとも自爆す る性質まである。捕獲の際はとにかく要注意。"},"level":8,"locations":[{"id":"inner-islets","name":{"en":"Inner Islets","ja":"内海列島"}},{"id":"altmeier","name":{"en":"Altmeier","ja":"アルトメイア"},"parent":"inner-islets"}],"categories":[{"id":"fish","name":{"en":"(Fish)","ja":"（魚）"},"icon":"totori-category-fish"},{"id":"gunpowder","name":{"en":"(Gunpowder)","ja":"（火薬）"},"icon":"totori-category-gunpowder"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":49}